{
  "_comment": [
    "CURATED, APPEND-ONLY, and hand-ordered: the grouping and the order here are for humans,",
    "nothing reads them. Edit it by hand. One tool appends to it: the admin-panel sync",
    "(internal/handlers/costumes_github.go) PRs names added in the panel onto the END of the",
    "'shared' and 'hidden' arrays below, splicing whole lines into these bytes rather than",
    "re-marshalling the file, so it can never reorder or reformat anything you wrote here.",
    "A costume label is USER DATA: user_shinies.costume is free text that trainers type,",
    "so renaming a label orphans the costume art on entries people have already saved.",
    "Add new labels freely; to rename one, add the old spelling to 'aliases' instead.",
    "Codes, dex eligibility and shiny availability are NOT here: they are derived from the",
    "asset tree into catalog.json by 'make costumes'. A label whose code is missing from the",
    "catalog is inert automatically, so a pre-release costume needs no 'pending' flag.",
    "Code format is '<p>:<CODE>' where p is c (costume overlay) or f (full form)."
  ],

