  "_hidden_comment": [
    "Codes the game flags as costumes but that are not costumes a trainer would record: the",
    "Gimmighoul coin forms, and the duplicate _NOEVOLVE twins of a costume already listed above",
    "(same art, separate code for the version that cannot evolve). Listing them here keeps them",
    "out of the review queue instead of nagging on every run.",
    "A second shared entry under an existing label (Party Hat, Flower Crown, Visor) is",
    "deliberate: the same costume theme was re-run under a new code for different species, and",
    "resolution takes the first entry whose code actually has art for that species."
  ],
