  "_nameCheckIgnore_comment": [
    "Codes where we knowingly use a different word than Dittobase does, and ours is the one we",
    "want. Listing them here keeps the name check silent on known divergences, so that a NEW",
    "mismatch (a label pointing at the wrong costume) stands out instead of hiding in the noise.",
    "Only add a code here once you have LOOKED AT THE SPRITE and confirmed our label is right."
  ],
